Long tran for the interrupt test

ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
load "capacitor.osdi"
model resistor resistor
model capacitor capacitor
model vsource vsource

v1 (1 0) vsource dc=0 type="sine" sinedc=0.0 ampl=1 freq=1k
r1 (1 2) resistor r=1k
c1 (2 0) capacitor c=1u

control
  options rawfile="binary"
  analysis tr1 tran step=1n stop=10 maxstep=1n
endc
